ool the append path draws on.\",\n      \"line\": 25,\n      \"span\": \"the memory that costs is charged to the same pool the append path draws on\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Processor load looks unremarkable while memory sits high.\",\n      \"line\": 26,\n      \"span\": \"processor load looks unremarkable while memory sits high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Processor load and memory do not agree.\",\n      \"line\": 26,\n      \"span\": \"The two do not agree\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":86091,"type":"result","duration_ms":89600,"uuid":"f7dfdb96-4db3-4dea-96c1-df4a90dc41bb","ttft_stream_ms":992,"time_to_request_ms":95,"first_content_frame_ms":992,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
